      "role": "user",
      "content": "The board is leaning heavily toward the full decentralization though. They're worried about the entire system going down if one central hub fails. Can you run a more detailed simulation? Specifically, I need to see the projected impact on life-critical medication delivery—like insulin and oncology drugs—if we move to the 50-node setup. Show me the worst-case scenario for fulfillment during the transition period.",
